#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "518400"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "518456"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "518540"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "518620"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "518688"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "518728"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "518760"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518792"
msgid "As if sinking into watery depths,\nwe descend into a dense darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518860"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003Rani#CDEF put this shooting star design here in her mind.\nIt's a fitting mental image of astrology, which #C236196003Rani#CDEF likes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519020"
msgid "Maybe one could call it mystery? Unfathomable.\nImpossible. Indivisible. Incomprehensible.\nOr, strange. Odd. Uncanny. An enigma."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519148"
msgid "I don't understand.\nI don't understand.\nIt's always something that I can't grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519232"
msgid "Among them, #[he][she]# is a superbly incomprehensible\nperson. I'm talking about you, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519356"
msgid "You've disappointed me. My measurements\nconclude that you have a fatal deficiency\nin ability to regulate your lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519480"
msgid "Predicting the actions of hostile objects,\nsmoothing reality-conflicting tumults,\nstoicism reaching for a higher self――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519604"
msgid "And what you lack most of all \nis respect for your transplendent kouhai, \nwho can teach you all of these things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519720"
msgid "I want you to improve at once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519752"
msgid "Hm. I recognize the phrasing of that logic.\nVery similar to that of my tutor, Seneca."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519840"
msgid "So, basically what she's saying is\n\"praise your cute kouhai more.\" That #C236196003Rani#CDEF―\nit seems that she's felt very lonely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519976"
msgid "If #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is a wolf in honors student\nclothing, then #C236196003Rani#CDEF is a spectacled intellectual\npretending to be a machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520128"
msgid "It looks like she couldn't resist wanting to\nbe praised by you, on account of\nher shamelessness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520228"
msgid "We'll refuse, obviously. No need for that kind\nof improvement. Let's snap this unnecessary\nevent flag right over our knees, Darling鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520364"
msgid "Just desserts for a puppet with a mind. If she's\nnot recognized as useful by humans, then she\ncan't assess her own faculties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520492"
msgid "A foolish worry, but indulge her anyway. What?\nProbing into things or humans won't change them.\nIt's about whether you're compatible or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520636"
msgid "…no. The problem lies not just with you.\nMan's lack of self-restraint worsens many\nmatters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520732"
msgid "Seeing what should not be seen;\ntouching what should not be touched;\neating what should not be eaten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520836"
msgid "So with the Creator's apple, so with that box\nof hope… so with my secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520912"
msgid "I am #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF.\nA new race of human―granted by man a data\nprocessing capability which surpasses his own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521036"
msgid "I have to impose a maximum priority observation,\ninstruction, and reform to all of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's\nemotions and actions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521168"
msgid "I am the helm which steers that purpose.\nThere's no room to involve personal feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521256"
msgid "Truly, absolutely none.\nI will treat my elevated heart rate as I do\nany miscalculation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521344"
msgid "…it's natural for my cheeks to be flushed.\nI deduce that it's due to my almost burning\nsense of responsibility to my important duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521480"
msgid "Aghh! She's perfectly drenched in selfishness!\nIt's not fair!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521544"
msgid "To begin with, my Praetor's freedom belongs to\nME! Being contracted, raising my Master\nto become first-rate is MY role!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521664"
msgid "…I can't believe it's come to this. There's a\nwoman, extremely enthusiastic about educating,\nwho has her eyes on you, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521792"
msgid "I made light of her. This person is trouble.\nI deem that once she matures, she'll become a\nterribly unsound female scientist or jailer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521928"
msgid "There's no need to hold back anymore.\nThis is our chance to make #C236196003RANI#CDEF the\nreformed one, for her sake!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522048"
msgid "He who uses a machine becomes controlled\nby it―――This is one way in which\ncivilizations frequently meet their end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522168"
msgid "With my high computational ability,\nthe control of human actions and emotions\nis a supreme challenge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522272"
msgid "Controlling someone. I've come to understand\nthat it itself is synonymous with\nacquiring someone's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522380"
msgid "Humans reclaim eternal paradise by throwing off\ntheir worthless fixations and becoming naked,\ndefenseless in mind and body beside me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522516"
msgid "You. Especially you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nYou're foolish, like a sweet fruit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522600"
msgid "Mustn't you, predominantly and intensively,\nreceive the honor of my teachings?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522680"
msgid "Entrust all of yourself to me. We'll both be\nin a logical and natural form… Ahh, what a\nsplendid plan…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522788"
msgid "Rising body temperature confirmed. Fluctuations\nin pulse and breathing measured. Right now, I'm\nin a drunken state induced by medicine…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522928"
msgid "The voice of her unconscious mind wasn't\nrejecting an invading, foreign body;\nrather, it was filled with an intoxication as if welcoming it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523072"
msgid "What we can do, the only thing we can do,\nis to descend into the #RUBS      Id  #RUBEwellspring#REND of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's\nunconscious mind without damaging it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523240"
msgid "―――A journey through an infinitely hallucinating mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523300"
msgid "After the sensation of a moment―or an eternity―\npassed, I came to see the center of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's mind―――"
msgstr ""

